   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Human Development among industrial workers and local communities in Gampaha</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Based in the rapidly industrialising Gampaha District, the project seeks to address the needs of industrial workers, who are often recent and temporary migrants to Gampaha, unorganised and vulnerable; and of local residents affected by major infrastructural projects, industrial pollution and environmental deterioration.  It works by educating people about the issues affecting them, and about the relevant legislation and options for action, and mobilising them to become active and engaged citizens.</narrative>
  </description>
